        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-7" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-8" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-8" value="创建并完成注册监听的子进程" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="613.5" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-9" value="1. 事件对象：子进程内存中 保存 一个事件怎么处理，先注释什么状态的记录，其中包含：关联数据引用，处理函数，读写类型，状态标记，超时信息等数据；&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 三个队列：&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;接收事件队列：执行接收新连接事件；&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;普通事件队列：已有连接的读取，发送等事件；&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;下一轮队列：需要下一轮推进的事件；" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;align=left;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1058.5" y="200" width="235" height="159.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-10" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-12" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-13">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-11" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-12" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-16">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-12" value="初始化超时管理结构" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1360" y="613.5" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-13" value="1. 建立计时结构：一颗红黑树，记录按到期时间排列的事件清单，主要管理事件相关的等待是否超时；&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 到期时间 = 当前时间（单调时钟：linux中，系统启动时就开始运行的一只公共秒表） + 允许等待时长；&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. 不同的事件，到期之后处理逻辑不一样，例如事件：客户端上传数据，处理为“结束超时的请求”" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1317" y="204" width="278" height="155.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-14" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-16" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-17">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-15" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-16" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-20">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-16" value="创建通知实例" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1560" y="613.5" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-17" value="子进程先在内核中创建通知实例，再向其中登记监听套接字，登记时内核会将对应等待项加入该监听套接字的等待队列。" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;hachureGap=4;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1502" y="471" width="221" height="53" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-18" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-20" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-21">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-19" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-20" target="X-h-Y5wg-1FgEsjnu-qM-24">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
